WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Inspection reports, ready for review.
Without retyping your field notes.
Readings, photos and findings flow into a draft for review and approval.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:16.000
The inspection is done. Is the report still waiting?
The readings are recorded. The photo is taken. Someone still has to assemble the report.
See field entries become a report draft for the office.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Site details are ready. Add this inspection’s results.
Open the site and system, then record the new readings.
Previous readings are shown for comparison alongside the new entry fields.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Record it in the field. Carry it into the report.
The technician enters the waterflow alarm time and main drain readings.
The same values appear in the draft, without retyping them in the office.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:43.000
The photo comes with the finding and location.
A painted sprinkler in Room 214. The photo and note stay with the inspection.
The reviewer can see which finding the photo documents.

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:50.000
The data is in the draft. Review can begin.
Readings, findings and photos appear together in the report.
The office checks the draft and resolves missing details before approval.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:59.000
Check each entry against the field record.
Open the submitted record and compare it with the draft.
Office amendments retain a reason and the previous values.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:08.000
A detail is missing? Keep the request with the job.
The reviewer asks for the sprinkler location within Room 214.
The technician receives the note inside the same inspection.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:17.000
Complete the detail. Update the report.
The technician adds the location and resubmits the inspection.
The office sees the updated entries and continues the review.

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:25.000
Approved for release. Ready for the customer.
The report includes the inspection results and the outstanding deficiency.
Report approval does not close the deficiency. Its status stays visible.

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:32.000
Start the next visit with the history at hand.
The current report and previous inspections stay with the same site.
Open an earlier report to see what was inspected and what has changed.

00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:40.000
See it work with your own report.
Get a mobile form and the report draft it produces.
Send a form and sample report. Within 3 business days; complex forms get an agreed delivery date.
